                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Awful! Just awful! \nI enjoy a good, gloomy, horror game that has decent puzzles. This has none of these things.\nI got fed up after a couple of minutes and just used a walkthrough as I had paid money for it.\nThe \"puzzles\" and irrelevant Hitler video just left me confused and wondered what the overall point was. There is about two odd jumpscares that add nothing or takeaway from what is happening.\nThe graphics aren't great either and there are numerous pointless rooms which again, left me wondering what was going on.\nYou can finish it within 30 minutes too which is no good thing either.\nI got it on sale and still left wondering, \"what was that all about?\"",
